{"id":"9a42bbee3cfe3d34","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-coherent-category.md","title":"稳定子对象并与严格初对象","display":"df-coherent-category — 稳定子对象并与严格初对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-coherent-category","aliases":["16-df-coherent-category","Coherent category","16-coherent-category"],"display":"df-coherent-category — 稳定子对象并与严格初对象","depends_on":["[[16-df-regular-category]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Definition 4.5.1 p. 266 (PDF 286)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-coherent-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-coherent-category</span><span>Coherent category</span><span>16-coherent-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coherent-category — 稳定子对象并与严格初对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.5.1 p. 266 (PDF 286)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为小范畴，正则性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\\)</span> 及其偏序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\">\\(\\leq_I\\)</span>、拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}_I\">\\(\\mathrm{Join}_I\\)</span> 由下文定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vee_I T\">\\(S\\vee_I T\\)</span> 仅在存在该最小上界时表示偏序中唯一的元素。可逆性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a> 的带范畴参数谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohCat},\\mathrm{Join}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohCat},\\mathrm{Join}\\)</span> 为本页定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCat}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\leq_IW\\land T\\leq_IW\\land\n(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\\\n((S\\leq_IU\\land T\\leq_IU)\\Longrightarrow W\\leq_IU),\\\\\nS\\vee_IT=W&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CohCat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\n(\\exists W\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\\ \\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\n(\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(J))\\\nu^*(S\\vee_JT)=u^*S\\vee_Iu^*T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\exists 0\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(0,X))\\ \\top\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal B(X,0))\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nS\\leq_IW\\land T\\leq_IW\\land\n(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\\\n((S\\leq_IU\\land T\\leq_IU)\\Longrightarrow W\\leq_IU),\\\\\nS\\vee_IT=W&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CohCat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\n(\\exists W\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I))\\ \\mathrm{Join}_I(S,T,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J))\n(\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(J))\\\nu^*(S\\vee_JT)=u^*S\\vee_Iu^*T\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\exists 0\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(0,X))\\ \\top\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{39mm}\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall h\\in\\mathcal B(X,0))\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.5.1, p. 266 (PDF 286)。这里正式定义最小上界，不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists(S\\vee T)\">\\(\\exists(S\\vee T)\\)</span> 当作已经解释的存在命题；由子对象偏序的反对称性保证其唯一性。严格初对象条件明确量化指向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的所有箭头，而非只量化从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 出发的箭头。普通对象的二元余积并不是本定义的必要条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为小范畴，正则性见 [[16-df-regular-category]]。$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)$ 及其偏序 $\\leq_I$、拉回 $u^*$ 见 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为小范畴，正则性见 [[16-df-regular-category]]。$\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)$ 及其偏序 $\\leq_I$、拉回 $u^*$ 见 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnch